    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> delegating to the given resource loader and\nsupporting additional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ProtocolResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ProtocolResolvers</code></a> registered in\n<code>spring.factories</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个委托给给定资源加载器并支持在`spring.factories`中注册的额外<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ProtocolResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ProtocolResolvers</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>springFactoriesLoader</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> used to load\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ProtocolResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ProtocolResolvers</code></a>",
      "translation": "",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>classLoader</code> - the class loader to use or <code>null</code> to use the default class\nloader",
      "translation": "",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resourceLoader</code> - the delegate resource loader",
      "translation": "<code>resourceLoader</code> - 委托资源加载器",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> delegating to the given resource loader and\nsupporting additional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ProtocolResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ProtocolResolvers</code></a> registered in\n<code>spring.factories</code>. The factories file will be resolved using the default\nclass loader at the time this call is made.",
      "translation": "",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "When not delegating to an existing resource loader, plain paths without a qualifier\nwill resolve to file system resources. This is different from\n<code>DefaultResourceLoader</code>, which resolves unqualified paths to classpath resources.",
      "translation": "当不委托给现有的资源加载器时，不带限定符的普通路径将解析为文件系统资源。这与<code>DefaultResourceLoader</code>不同，它将不带限定符的路径解析为类路径资源。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> supporting additional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ProtocolResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ProtocolResolvers</code></a> registered in <code>spring.factories</code>. The factories file will\nbe resolved using the default class loader at the time this call is made. Resources\nwill be resolved using the default class loader at the time they are resolved.",
      "translation": "",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> supporting additional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ProtocolResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ProtocolResolvers</code></a> registered in <code>spring.factories</code>. The factories files and\nresources will be resolved using the specified class loader.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> 支持额外的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ProtocolResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ProtocolResolvers</code></a> 注册在<code>spring.factories</code>。工厂文件和资源将使用指定的类加载器进行解析。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/DefaultResourceLoader.html#getResourceByPath(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\">getResourceByPath</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/DefaultResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\">DefaultResourceLoader</a></code>",
      "translation": "",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>preferFileResolution</code> - if file based resolution is preferred when a suitable\n<a href=\"ApplicationResourceLoader.FilePathResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.io\"><code>ApplicationResourceLoader.FilePathResolver</code></a> support the resource",
      "translation": "<code>preferFileResolution</code> - 当存在一个合适的 <a href=\"ApplicationResourceLoader.FilePathResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.io\"><code>ApplicationResourceLoader.FilePathResolver</code></a> 支持该资源时，优先使用基于文件的解析。",
